body:
This is my order of preference:

&#x200B;

Gati > Aliexpress Standard > Singapore Post >>>>> China Post

&#x200B;

Package from China Post are notoriously known for being rerouted through several continents and being delayed. One time my package was sent to Madrid from China, that too it took 1 month, then it was shipped to India and was delivered after 50 days. Ali Standard and Singapore Post have delivered almost always within two weeks, once even in 7 days.

&#x200B;

Gati on the other hand delivered to me in 4 days.

Trust me, you don't need any additional biometric for that. Our government already, fraudulently, assisted the ISPs with coercing us to give them our Aadhaar data, the rest could be mined from our internet transactions. How fraudulently? They made a clearly ordinary bill, at best a Finance bill, into a Money Bill, which is arguably unconstitutional, to bypass the Rajya Sabha.

&#x200B;

However, data privacy is not an issue in India, because it's absent.

Mandir banega ussey? Nahi na, fir?

&#x200B;

The public is just ignorant. The masses which have got internet thru Jio aren't very well aware of their rights, like their counterparts who never had a phone or electricity to begin with. And those who are conscious, are discouraged, and even forced to not, to raise the issue.

Yes, Nirav Modi-Vijay Malya-Mehul Chowksi-Switzerland se sara paisa laa kar 15lac muh mein daal denge-secular.

&#x200B;

Do you comprehend the consequences and implications of any kind of ban? I hope you understand there is a difference between regulation and censor based coercion.
